# --- Generated documentation ------------------------------------------------
# Doxygen output is regenerated byte-for-byte from the sources and rewritten wholesale
# on every run, so it carries no review signal while burying the changes that do: one
# `doxygen` run can add 400 files to a commit and push the real diff off the screen.
# Both the usual output directories and Doxygen's distinctive artefact names are listed,
# because the output path is configurable.
docs/html/
docs/latex/
docs/xml/
doc/html/
doc/latex/
html/
latex/
Doxyfile.generated
doxygen_*.log
*.md5
*_cgraph.svg
*_icgraph.svg
*__incl.svg
*__dep__incl.svg

# --- FirmGen / agent internals ----------------------------------------------
# Engine-scratch, not project content. The GUI already hides these from the file
# lists (see isHiddenContextFile.ts); ignoring them keeps them out of review too.
.refact/
kb_context.json

